# A loop of mandatory actions that puts a counter on a permanent each time round never comes back to the same position, and
# has no way to stop. Bot2 has Chainsaw ("Whenever one or more creatures die, put a rev counter on this Equipment"), cast
# on turn 4 with no creature for its enters ability to damage. On turn 5 Bot1 animates its Entombed Worldgorger Dragon and
# the loop of the draw scenarios begins, every step of it forced; each time Animate Dead's leaves ability sacrifices the
# Dragon, Chainsaw's ability, Bot2's alone, puts a rev counter on it. Round after round the board is the same but for one
# more counter and no player can do anything but pass: the game goes on until its history reaches the engine's limit, and
# is a draw (docs/rules-exceptions.md, RX-1), here a low limit - not a game that never ends.

[Event Limit]
10000

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Animate Dead
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Worldgorger Dragon
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Chainsaw
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Worldgorger Dragon)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Chainsaw.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain; Chainsaw
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Worldgorger Dragon)

[Expect]
Result = Draw
DrawReason = EventLimit
Bot1.Status = (absent)
Bot2.Status = (absent)
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
Turn = 5
Step = Main1
